## Supabase API Patterns

- Client: [shared/api/supabase.js](mdc:src/shared/api/supabase.js)
- Table names: [shared/constants/db.js](mdc:src/shared/constants/db.js)
- Response shaping: [shared/api/db.js](mdc:src/shared/api/db.js) `handleResponse`
- Transformers map snake_case ↔ camelCase

### Feature APIs

- Auth: [features/auth/api/auth.js](mdc:src/features/auth/api/auth.js)
- Tasks: [features/pomodoro/api/tasks.js](mdc:src/features/pomodoro/api/tasks.js)
- Journals: [features/journals/api/journals.js](mdc:src/features/journals/api/journals.js)
- User Settings: [features/settings/api/userSettings.js](mdc:src/features/settings/api/userSettings.js)

### API Conventions

- Validate `userId` on mutating calls; return `{ error: "User authentication required" }` if missing.
- Transform payloads to DB shape via transformers before insert/update.
- Post-process responses via `handleResponse`, then transform back to camelCase.
- Use explicit `.select()` after inserts/updates when you need returned rows.
